So unified rule: 3 where left cell == right cell == the shared... In demo1 left bg 4, marker 8; right bg... demo1 right side was 8s and 5s — right bg = 5? right marker = 8? And 3 where both cells equal and equal to... in demo1, 3 where both = 8 = right primary = left marker. In demo2, 3 where both = 7 = right primary = left background! Hmm inconsistent roles.

